<title>HONG KONG: HK &amp; China Gas interim net up 20.1 pct.</title>
<headline>HK &amp; China Gas interim net up 20.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   33.0    vs 27.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    12.0    vs 10.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    979.1   vs 815.4</p>
<p>Turnover</p>
<p>2,494.4 vs 2,225.3</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 7-9</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong and China Gas produces and distributes gas.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and interim dividend have been adjusted for the one-for-five bonus issue of shares on May 1, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
